 "1": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 446\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"np.arange(12) reshaped to a 3 by 4 array, with the slice b[1:, 1:3] highlighted and copied out as a 2 by 2 view\">\n<defs><marker id=\"ar21\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n<marker id=\"ar21b\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"/></marker></defs>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-family:var(--mono)\">a = np.arange(12) · shape (12,) · value = index</text>\n<rect x=\"60\" y=\"38\" width=\"600\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<path d=\"M110,38V78M160,38V78M210,38V78M260,38V78M310,38V78M360,38V78M410,38V78M460,38V78M510,38V78M560,38V78M610,38V78\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.2;fill:none\"/>\n<text x=\"85\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">0</text>\n<text x=\"135\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">1</text>\n<text x=\"185\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">2</text>\n<text x=\"235\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">3</text>\n<text x=\"285\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">4</text>\n<text x=\"335\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">5</text>\n<text x=\"385\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">6</text>\n<text x=\"435\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">7</text>\n<text x=\"485\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">8</text>\n<text x=\"535\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">9</text>\n<text x=\"585\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">10</text>\n<text x=\"635\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">11</text>\n<line x1=\"330\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"146\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar21)\"/>\n<text x=\"344\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-family:var(--mono)\">b = a.reshape(3, 4)</text>\n<text x=\"344\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">shape (3, 4), same 12 values</text>\n<text x=\"110\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">axis 1: columns →</text>\n<text x=\"145\" y=\"191\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">0</text>\n<text x=\"215\" y=\"191\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">1</text>\n<text x=\"285\" y=\"191\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">2</text>\n<text x=\"355\" y=\"191\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">3</text>\n<text x=\"98\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">0</text>\n<text x=\"98\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">1</text>\n<text x=\"98\" y=\"314\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">2</text>\n<text x=\"0\" y=\"0\" transform=\"translate(62,264) rotate(-90)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">axis 0: rows (down)</text>\n<rect x=\"110\" y=\"198\" width=\"280\" height=\"132\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"242\" width=\"140\" height=\"88\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft)\"/>\n<path d=\"M180,198V330M250,198V330M320,198V330M110,242H390M110,286H390\" style=\"stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.2;fill:none\"/>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"242\" width=\"140\" height=\"88\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:3\"/>\n<text x=\"145\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">0</text>\n<text x=\"215\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">1</text>\n<text x=\"285\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">2</text>\n<text x=\"355\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">3</text>\n<text x=\"145\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">4</text>\n<text x=\"215\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">5</text>\n<text x=\"285\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">6</text>\n<text x=\"355\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">7</text>\n<text x=\"145\" y=\"314\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">8</text>\n<text x=\"215\" y=\"314\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">9</text>\n<text x=\"285\" y=\"314\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">10</text>\n<text x=\"355\" y=\"314\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">11</text>\n<line x1=\"324\" y1=\"286\" x2=\"434\" y2=\"318\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar21b)\"/>\n<text x=\"440\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-family:var(--mono)\">b[1:, 1:3]</text>\n<text x=\"440\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">rows 1 to the end,</text>\n<text x=\"440\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">columns 1 and 2 (stop 3 left out)</text>\n<rect x=\"440\" y=\"292\" width=\"140\" height=\"88\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<path d=\"M510,292V380M440,336H580\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:1.2;fill:none\"/>\n<text x=\"475\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">5</text>\n<text x=\"545\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">6</text>\n<text x=\"475\" y=\"364\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">9</text>\n<text x=\"545\" y=\"364\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\">10</text>\n<text x=\"440\" y=\"404\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">a view: shares memory with b</text>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"432\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">Row-major order: 0–3 fill row 0, 4–7 fill row 1, 8–11 fill row 2.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.1.1</b> Twelve values in a 1-D array are reshaped into 3 rows and 4 columns without copying them. The slice <code>b[1:, 1:3]</code> (orange) takes rows 1–2 and columns 1–2. Notice that the stop number 3 is left out, and that the slice is a view, so changing it changes <code>b</code>.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "2": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 330\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Anatomy of a DataFrame: row index labels, column labels, positions, a column selected as a Series and a row selected with loc\">\n<text x=\"335\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">column labels: df.columns</text>\n<line x1=\"335\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"335\" y2=\"68\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"128\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">iloc</text>\n<rect x=\"150\" y=\"70\" width=\"370\" height=\"216\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"150\" y=\"70\" width=\"370\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft)\"/>\n<rect x=\"150\" y=\"106\" width=\"80\" height=\"180\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft)\"/>\n<rect x=\"150\" y=\"142\" width=\"370\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft)\"/>\n<path d=\"M230,70V286M350,70V286M430,70V286M150,106H520M150,142H520M150,178H520M150,214H520M150,250H520\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.2;fill:none\"/>\n<rect x=\"150\" y=\"142\" width=\"370\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:3\"/>\n<rect x=\"350\" y=\"70\" width=\"80\" height=\"216\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:3\"/>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">city</text>\n<text x=\"390\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">temp</text>\n<text x=\"475\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">rain_mm</text>\n<text x=\"190\" y=\"129\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">MAA</text>\n<text x=\"190\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">DEL</text>\n<text x=\"190\" y=\"201\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">BOM</text>\n<text x=\"190\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">CCU</text>\n<text x=\"190\" y=\"273\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">BLR</text>\n<text x=\"128\" y=\"129\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">0</text>\n<text x=\"128\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">1</text>\n<text x=\"128\" y=\"201\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">2</text>\n<text x=\"128\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">3</text>\n<text x=\"128\" y=\"273\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">4</text>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"129\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Chennai</text>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Delhi</text>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"201\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Mumbai</text>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Kolkata</text>\n<text x=\"290\" y=\"273\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Bengaluru</text>\n<text x=\"390\" y=\"129\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">34</text>\n<text x=\"390\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">41</text>\n<text x=\"390\" y=\"201\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">31</text>\n<text x=\"390\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">36</text>\n<text x=\"390\" y=\"273\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">29</text>\n<text x=\"475\" y=\"129\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">12</text>\n<text x=\"475\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">0</text>\n<text x=\"475\" y=\"201\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">48</text>\n<text x=\"475\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">20</text>\n<text x=\"475\" y=\"273\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">5</text>\n<text x=\"190\" y=\"308\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">row labels: df.index</text>\n<path d=\"M432,76H536V108H544\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5;fill:none\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" style=\"fill:var(--accent);font-family:var(--mono)\">df['temp']</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">a Series: the same</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">index + one column</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">of int64 values</text>\n<line x1=\"522\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"544\" y2=\"214\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" style=\"fill:var(--live);font-family:var(--mono)\">df.loc['DEL']</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"244\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"font-family:var(--mono)\" fill=\"currentColor\">= df.iloc[1]</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">one row, also</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">a Series</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.2.1</b> A DataFrame has column labels on top (blue band), row labels in the index (green), and hidden positions 0–4 on the left. Selecting the <code>temp</code> column or the <code>DEL</code> row each gives a Series. Notice that <code>loc</code> uses the labels and <code>iloc</code> uses the positions.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "3": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 340\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The student table with a duplicate row struck out and three missing cells filled with the median, the mode and the mean\">\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"40\" width=\"460\" height=\"272\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"40\" width=\"460\" height=\"34\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft)\"/>\n<rect x=\"90\" y=\"108\" width=\"110\" height=\"34\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft)\"/>\n<rect x=\"200\" y=\"142\" width=\"150\" height=\"34\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft)\"/>\n<rect x=\"350\" y=\"210\" width=\"130\" height=\"34\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft)\"/>\n<path d=\"M90,40V312M200,40V312M350,40V312M20,74H480M20,108H480M20,142H480M20,176H480M20,210H480M20,244H480M20,278H480\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.2;fill:none\"/>\n<text x=\"55\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">sid</text>\n<text x=\"145\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">age</text>\n<text x=\"275\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">city</text>\n<text x=\"415\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">fee (₹)</text>\n<text x=\"55\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">101</text>\n<text x=\"145\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">19</text>\n<text x=\"275\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Chennai</text>\n<text x=\"415\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">45000</text>\n<text x=\"55\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">102</text>\n<text x=\"145\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" style=\"fill:var(--next)\">NaN → 20</text>\n<text x=\"275\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Madurai</text>\n<text x=\"415\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">42000</text>\n<text x=\"55\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">103</text>\n<text x=\"145\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">21</text>\n<text x=\"275\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" style=\"fill:var(--next)\">NaN → Chennai</text>\n<text x=\"415\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">47000</text>\n<text x=\"55\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">102</text>\n<text x=\"145\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">NaN</text>\n<text x=\"275\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">Madurai</text>\n<text x=\"415\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">42000</text>\n<line x1=\"26\" y1=\"193\" x2=\"474\" y2=\"193\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\"/>\n<text x=\"55\" y=\"232\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">104</text>\n<text x=\"145\" y=\"232\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">20</text>\n<text x=\"275\" y=\"232\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Chennai</text>\n<text x=\"415\" y=\"232\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" style=\"fill:var(--next)\">NaN → 44800</text>\n<text x=\"55\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">105</text>\n<text x=\"145\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">26</text>\n<text x=\"275\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Coimbatore</text>\n<text x=\"415\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">44000</text>\n<text x=\"55\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">106</text>\n<text x=\"145\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">18</text>\n<text x=\"275\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Chennai</text>\n<text x=\"415\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">46000</text>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">7 rows read; one repeats, three cells are empty</text>\n<text x=\"500\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">Cleaning order</text>\n<text x=\"500\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">1  drop the repeat of 102</text>\n<text x=\"516\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">(all columns equal)</text>\n<text x=\"500\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--next)\">2  age: median of</text>\n<text x=\"516\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">18, 19, 20, 21, 26 = 20</text>\n<text x=\"500\" y=\"196\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--next)\">3  city: mode = Chennai</text>\n<text x=\"516\" y=\"216\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">(3 of the 5 known)</text>\n<text x=\"500\" y=\"248\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--next)\">4  fee: mean of 5 known</text>\n<text x=\"516\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">2,24,000 / 5 = 44,800</text>\n<text x=\"500\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">6 clean rows remain</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.3.1</b> The student table of the worked example. The repeated row for sid 102 is struck out first (orange); then each hole is filled by a rule that suits its column (green): the median for age, the mode for the city name, the mean for the fee. Notice that the fill values are computed on the 6 rows left after the duplicate is gone.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "4": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 284\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Dot plot and box plot of eleven daily sales values with the IQR fences at 9.75 and 23.75 and the value 48 flagged as an outlier\">\n<text x=\"177\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">lower fence 9.75</text>\n<text x=\"345\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">upper fence 23.75</text>\n<line x1=\"177\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"177\" y2=\"214\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:5 4\"/>\n<line x1=\"345\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"345\" y2=\"214\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:5 4\"/>\n<text x=\"264\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">median 17</text>\n<text x=\"236\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">Q1 15</text>\n<text x=\"286\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">Q3 18.5</text>\n<path d=\"M204,130H240M282,130H312M204,120V140M312,120V140\" style=\"stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5;fill:none\"/>\n<rect x=\"240\" y=\"110\" width=\"42\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<line x1=\"264\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"264\" y2=\"150\" style=\"stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:2.5\"/>\n<circle cx=\"204\" cy=\"200\" r=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"200\" r=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"200\" r=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"186\" r=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"200\" r=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"264\" cy=\"200\" r=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"276\" cy=\"200\" r=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"276\" cy=\"186\" r=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"200\" r=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"312\" cy=\"200\" r=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"636\" cy=\"200\" r=\"7\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"/>\n<text x=\"636\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">48 &gt; 23.75: outlier</text>\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"660\" y2=\"220\" style=\"stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M60,220V226M180,220V226M300,220V226M420,220V226M540,220V226M660,220V226\" style=\"stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5;fill:none\"/>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"242\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">0</text>\n<text x=\"180\" y=\"242\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">10</text>\n<text x=\"300\" y=\"242\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">20</text>\n<text x=\"420\" y=\"242\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">30</text>\n<text x=\"540\" y=\"242\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">40</text>\n<text x=\"660\" y=\"242\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">50</text>\n<text x=\"360\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">daily sales of a tea shop (₹ thousand), 11 days</text>\n<text x=\"430\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">IQR = 18.5 − 15 = 3.5</text>\n<text x=\"430\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">1.5 × IQR = 5.25</text>\n<text x=\"430\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">mean 19.36, s = 9.82</text>\n<text x=\"430\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">z of 48 = 2.92 &lt; 3</text>\n<text x=\"430\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">z-rule misses it (masking)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.4.1</b> The eleven sales values of the worked example as dots (stacked where two days are equal), with the box plot above them. The dashed fences sit 1.5 × IQR beyond the box. Notice that 48 lies far past the upper fence, yet its z-score is only 2.92, because 48 itself inflated the mean and the standard deviation.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "5": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Twelve ages binned two ways: equal width gives 7, 3 and 2 values per bin; equal frequency gives 4 per bin with bin means 21, 30.25 and 51.25\">\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">Equal width: pd.cut(ages, 3), each bin 15 years wide</text>\n<rect x=\"96\" y=\"50\" width=\"180\" height=\"66\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"276\" y=\"50\" width=\"180\" height=\"66\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"456\" y=\"50\" width=\"180\" height=\"66\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"186\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">18–33: 7 values</text>\n<text x=\"366\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">33–48: 3 values</text>\n<text x=\"546\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">48–63: 2 values</text>\n<g style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">\n<circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"94\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"94\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"144\" cy=\"94\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"94\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"192\" cy=\"94\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"94\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"94\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"94\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"94\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"444\" cy=\"94\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"540\" cy=\"94\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"636\" cy=\"94\" r=\"5.5\"/>\n</g>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">Equal frequency: pd.qcut(ages, 3), 4 values per bin</text>\n<rect x=\"96\" y=\"164\" width=\"88\" height=\"70\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"184\" y=\"164\" width=\"136\" height=\"70\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"320\" y=\"164\" width=\"316\" height=\"70\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"140\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">4 values</text>\n<text x=\"252\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">4 values</text>\n<text x=\"478\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">4 values</text>\n<g style=\"fill:var(--next)\">\n<circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"202\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"202\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"144\" cy=\"202\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"202\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"192\" cy=\"202\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"202\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"202\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"202\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"202\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"444\" cy=\"202\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"540\" cy=\"202\" r=\"5.5\"/><circle cx=\"636\" cy=\"202\" r=\"5.5\"/>\n</g>\n<text x=\"140\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">mean 21</text>\n<text x=\"252\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">mean 30.25</text>\n<text x=\"478\" y=\"226\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">mean 51.25</text>\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"660\" y2=\"250\" style=\"stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M60,250V256M180,250V256M300,250V256M420,250V256M540,250V256M660,250V256\" style=\"stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5;fill:none\"/>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"272\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">15</text>\n<text x=\"180\" y=\"272\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">25</text>\n<text x=\"300\" y=\"272\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">35</text>\n<text x=\"420\" y=\"272\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">45</text>\n<text x=\"540\" y=\"272\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">55</text>\n<text x=\"660\" y=\"272\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">65</text>\n<text x=\"360\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">age of 12 customers (years)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.5.1</b> The same twelve ages binned two ways. Equal width (top) gives bins of the same length but uneven counts, 7, 3 and 2. Equal frequency (bottom) gives 4 values in every bin, so the bins have different lengths; its cut points are 25.33 and 36.67. Notice how the equal-frequency bins stretch where the data thin out, from 40 to 63.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "6": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 372\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two tables, students and marks, and the rows produced by inner, left, right and outer merges on sid\">\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">students</text>\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"50\" width=\"200\" height=\"110\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<text y=\"74\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\"><tspan x=\"36\">sid</tspan><tspan x=\"96\">name</tspan></text>\n<text y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><tspan x=\"36\">1</tspan><tspan x=\"96\">Asha</tspan></text>\n<text y=\"124\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><tspan x=\"36\">2</tspan><tspan x=\"96\">Ravi</tspan></text>\n<text y=\"148\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--next)\"><tspan x=\"36\">3</tspan><tspan x=\"96\">Meena</tspan></text>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"196\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">marks</text>\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"206\" width=\"250\" height=\"136\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<text y=\"230\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\"><tspan x=\"36\">sid</tspan><tspan x=\"96\">subject</tspan><tspan x=\"196\">score</tspan></text>\n<text y=\"256\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><tspan x=\"36\">1</tspan><tspan x=\"96\">Maths</tspan><tspan x=\"196\">82</tspan></text>\n<text y=\"280\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><tspan x=\"36\">1</tspan><tspan x=\"96\">DS</tspan><tspan x=\"196\">91</tspan></text>\n<text y=\"304\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\"><tspan x=\"36\">2</tspan><tspan x=\"96\">Maths</tspan><tspan x=\"196\">67</tspan></text>\n<text y=\"328\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"><tspan x=\"36\">4</tspan><tspan x=\"96\">DS</tspan><tspan x=\"196\">75</tspan></text>\n<text x=\"300\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-family:var(--mono)\">merge(students, marks, on='sid', how=…)</text>\n<text x=\"300\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">inner: 3 rows</text>\n<text x=\"300\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">left: 4 rows</text>\n<text x=\"300\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">right: 4 rows</text>\n<text x=\"300\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">outer: 5 rows</text>\n<g style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.2\">\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"90\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\"/><rect x=\"380\" y=\"90\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\"/><rect x=\"460\" y=\"90\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\"/>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"160\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\"/><rect x=\"380\" y=\"160\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\"/><rect x=\"460\" y=\"160\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\"/>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"230\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\"/><rect x=\"380\" y=\"230\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\"/><rect x=\"460\" y=\"230\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\"/>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"300\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\"/><rect x=\"380\" y=\"300\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\"/><rect x=\"460\" y=\"300\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\"/>\n</g>\n<rect x=\"540\" y=\"160\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:1.2\"/>\n<rect x=\"540\" y=\"300\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:1.2\"/>\n<rect x=\"540\" y=\"230\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:1.2\"/>\n<rect x=\"620\" y=\"300\" width=\"74\" height=\"26\" rx=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:1.2\"/>\n<g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n<text x=\"337\" y=\"108\">1 Maths</text><text x=\"417\" y=\"108\">1 DS</text><text x=\"497\" y=\"108\">2 Maths</text>\n<text x=\"337\" y=\"178\">1 Maths</text><text x=\"417\" y=\"178\">1 DS</text><text x=\"497\" y=\"178\">2 Maths</text><text x=\"577\" y=\"178\">3 NaN</text>\n<text x=\"337\" y=\"248\">1 Maths</text><text x=\"417\" y=\"248\">1 DS</text><text x=\"497\" y=\"248\">2 Maths</text><text x=\"577\" y=\"248\">4 NaN</text>\n<text x=\"337\" y=\"318\">1 Maths</text><text x=\"417\" y=\"318\">1 DS</text><text x=\"497\" y=\"318\">2 Maths</text><text x=\"577\" y=\"318\">3 NaN</text><text x=\"657\" y=\"318\">4 NaN</text>\n</g>\n<text x=\"300\" y=\"358\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">blue: key in both · green: students only · orange: marks only</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.6.1</b> Merging on <code>sid</code>. Key 1 appears twice in <code>marks</code>, so Asha appears in two result rows. Meena (sid 3) has no marks and sid 4 has no name; each join type decides whether those rows survive, with NaN for the missing side.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "7": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 324\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A Series with a two-level index of city and quarter, unstacked into a city by quarter table, with selections by loc\">\n<defs><marker id=\"ar27\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker></defs>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-family:var(--mono)\">t = raw.groupby(['city', 'quarter'])['sales'].sum()</text>\n<text x=\"85\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">level 0</text>\n<text x=\"170\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">level 1</text>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"60\" width=\"250\" height=\"176\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"60\" width=\"250\" height=\"32\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft)\"/>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"164\" width=\"250\" height=\"72\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft)\"/>\n<rect x=\"210\" y=\"128\" width=\"80\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft)\"/>\n<path d=\"M130,60V236M210,60V236M40,92H290M130,128H290M40,164H290M130,200H290\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.2;fill:none\"/>\n<rect x=\"40\" y=\"164\" width=\"250\" height=\"72\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"210\" y=\"128\" width=\"80\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2.5\"/>\n<text x=\"85\" y=\"81\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">city</text>\n<text x=\"170\" y=\"81\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">quarter</text>\n<text x=\"250\" y=\"81\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">sales</text>\n<text x=\"85\" y=\"133\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">Chennai</text>\n<text x=\"85\" y=\"205\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">Delhi</text>\n<text x=\"170\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Q1</text>\n<text x=\"170\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Q2</text>\n<text x=\"170\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Q1</text>\n<text x=\"170\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Q2</text>\n<text x=\"250\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">12</text>\n<text x=\"250\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">20</text>\n<text x=\"250\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">24</text>\n<text x=\"250\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">18</text>\n<line x1=\"306\" y1=\"126\" x2=\"414\" y2=\"126\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar27)\"/>\n<text x=\"360\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--accent);font-family:var(--mono)\">unstack()</text>\n<line x1=\"414\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"160\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar27)\"/>\n<text x=\"360\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--accent);font-family:var(--mono)\">stack()</text>\n<rect x=\"430\" y=\"92\" width=\"270\" height=\"108\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"430\" y=\"92\" width=\"270\" height=\"36\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft)\"/>\n<path d=\"M540,92V200M620,92V200M430,128H700M430,164H700\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.2;fill:none\"/>\n<text x=\"485\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">city</text>\n<text x=\"580\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">Q1</text>\n<text x=\"660\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">Q2</text>\n<text x=\"485\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">Chennai</text>\n<text x=\"485\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">Delhi</text>\n<text x=\"580\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">12</text>\n<text x=\"660\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">20</text>\n<text x=\"580\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">24</text>\n<text x=\"660\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">18</text>\n<text x=\"565\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">quarter level now in the columns</text>\n<text x=\"40\" y=\"264\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--live);font-family:var(--mono)\">t.loc['Delhi']             → Q1 24, Q2 18</text>\n<text x=\"40\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"14\" style=\"fill:var(--next);font-family:var(--mono)\">t.loc[('Chennai', 'Q2')]   → 20</text>\n<text x=\"40\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-family:var(--mono)\">t.groupby(level='city').sum() → Chennai 32, Delhi 42</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.7.1</b> Left: a Series with a two-level index (city, quarter); the outer label is printed once per block. Right: <code>unstack()</code> moves the quarter level into the columns, giving a city × quarter table; <code>stack()</code> reverses it. Notice the two kinds of selection: a whole outer block (orange) and one full tuple (green).</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "8": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 338\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Three pipelines: filter scores features before the model, wrapper loops between choosing a subset and training the model, embedded selects during training\">\n<defs><marker id=\"ar28\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">Filter: score features first, no model (fast)</text>\n<g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\">\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"40\" width=\"140\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"40\" width=\"160\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"400\" y=\"40\" width=\"130\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"570\" y=\"40\" width=\"130\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/>\n</g>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">Wrapper: search subsets with the model (slow)</text>\n<g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\">\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"146\" width=\"140\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"146\" width=\"160\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"400\" y=\"146\" width=\"130\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"570\" y=\"146\" width=\"130\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/>\n</g>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" style=\"fill:var(--next)\">Embedded: the model selects while it trains</text>\n<g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\">\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"268\" width=\"140\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"268\" width=\"250\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"490\" y=\"268\" width=\"210\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\"/>\n</g>\n<g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n<text x=\"90\" y=\"64\">all n features</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"82\">X1 … Xn</text>\n<text x=\"280\" y=\"64\">score each alone:</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"82\">r, chi-square, MI</text>\n<text x=\"465\" y=\"64\">keep the</text><text x=\"465\" y=\"82\">top k</text>\n<text x=\"635\" y=\"64\">train the</text><text x=\"635\" y=\"82\">model once</text>\n<text x=\"90\" y=\"170\">all n features</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"188\">X1 … Xn</text>\n<text x=\"280\" y=\"170\">pick a subset</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"188\">(add or remove one)</text>\n<text x=\"465\" y=\"170\">train, then</text><text x=\"465\" y=\"188\">validation score</text>\n<text x=\"635\" y=\"170\">best subset</text><text x=\"635\" y=\"188\">when gain stops</text>\n<text x=\"90\" y=\"292\">all n features</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"310\">X1 … Xn</text>\n<text x=\"325\" y=\"292\">train with an L1 penalty</text><text x=\"325\" y=\"310\">or grow a tree ensemble</text>\n<text x=\"595\" y=\"292\">keep weights ≠ 0</text><text x=\"595\" y=\"310\">or high importance</text>\n</g>\n<g style=\"stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#ar28)\">\n<line x1=\"162\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"196\" y2=\"68\"/><line x1=\"362\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"396\" y2=\"68\"/><line x1=\"532\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"566\" y2=\"68\"/>\n<line x1=\"162\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"196\" y2=\"174\"/><line x1=\"362\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"396\" y2=\"166\"/><line x1=\"532\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"566\" y2=\"174\"/>\n<line x1=\"162\" y1=\"296\" x2=\"196\" y2=\"296\"/><line x1=\"452\" y1=\"296\" x2=\"486\" y2=\"296\"/>\n</g>\n<path d=\"M465,204 V222 H280 V208\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#ar28)\"/>\n<text x=\"372\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">repeat</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.8.1</b> The three families of feature selection. A filter ranks features by a statistic before any model is trained (r is correlation, MI mutual information). A wrapper loops between choosing a subset and training the model on it. An embedded method lets the model drop features during training. Notice that only the wrapper trains the model many times.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
 "9": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 316\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ETL pipeline from three sources through extract, staging, transform and load into a data warehouse that feeds dashboards\">\n<defs><marker id=\"ar29\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs>\n<g style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:2\">\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"40\" width=\"160\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"108\" width=\"160\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"176\" width=\"160\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\"/>\n</g>\n<text x=\"100\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">Sources</text>\n<g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n<text x=\"100\" y=\"63\" font-weight=\"600\">Chennai branch</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"82\">CSV, amounts in ₹</text>\n<text x=\"100\" y=\"131\" font-weight=\"600\">Bengaluru branch</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"150\">CSV, amounts in paise</text>\n<text x=\"100\" y=\"199\" font-weight=\"600\">Payments API</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"218\">JSON records</text>\n</g>\n<text x=\"210\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">1 Extract</text>\n<g style=\"stroke:var(--ink);stroke-width:1.8;fill:none\" marker-end=\"url(#ar29)\">\n<path d=\"M182,67 C210,67 210,120 236,128\"/><line x1=\"182\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"135\"/><path d=\"M182,203 C210,203 210,150 236,142\"/>\n<line x1=\"352\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"135\"/><line x1=\"551\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"598\" y2=\"135\"/><line x1=\"655\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"655\" y2=\"206\"/>\n</g>\n<rect x=\"240\" y=\"100\" width=\"110\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--bg);stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:2;stroke-dasharray:6 4\"/>\n<text x=\"295\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">staging</text>\n<text x=\"295\" y=\"149\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">raw copies</text>\n<rect x=\"394\" y=\"40\" width=\"154\" height=\"190\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<text x=\"471\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">2 Transform</text>\n<g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n<text x=\"406\" y=\"68\">rename to one schema</text><text x=\"406\" y=\"98\">paise → rupees</text><text x=\"406\" y=\"128\">dates → one format</text><text x=\"406\" y=\"158\">match keys, dedupe</text><text x=\"406\" y=\"188\">join, aggregate</text><text x=\"406\" y=\"218\">validate counts</text>\n</g>\n<text x=\"575\" y=\"124\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">3 Load</text>\n<rect x=\"602\" y=\"94\" width=\"106\" height=\"80\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--next-soft);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<text x=\"655\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"currentColor\">warehouse</text>\n<text x=\"655\" y=\"141\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">fact and</text>\n<text x=\"655\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">dimension tables</text>\n<rect x=\"602\" y=\"210\" width=\"106\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--next);stroke-width:2\"/>\n<text x=\"655\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">dashboards, ML</text>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">ETL: transform before loading. ELT: load raw data first, then transform inside the warehouse.</text>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"302\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\">Runs on a schedule (nightly or hourly); an incremental extract reads only rows changed since the last run.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>Figure 2.9.1</b> An ETL pipeline for the worked example. Two branch files and a payments feed are extracted into a staging area, transformed into one schema with one unit and one date format, and loaded into the warehouse that dashboards and models read. Notice that the transform box is where the problems of integration are solved.</figcaption>\n</figure>"
}